# 5. TARGET EMPLOYEE EXPERIENCE

The employee should be able to access most common HR functions from one place.

Example:

```text
Employee Login
      ↓
Employee Home
      |
      +── Attendance
      |
      +── Leave
      |
      +── Payroll
      |
      +── Expenses
      |
      +── Loans
      |
      +── Performance
      |
      +── Training
      |
      +── Documents
      |
      +── Requests
      |
      +── Announcements
      |
      +── Directory
      |
      +── Profile
      |
      +── Notifications
```

---

