# 10. PROFILE EDITING

Employees may update permitted information.

Examples:

```text
Phone
Personal Email
Address
Emergency Contact
Profile Photo
Bank information where permitted
Personal details where permitted
```

Sensitive changes should require verification or approval if existing architecture supports it.

Do not allow employees to directly change:

```text
Employee ID
Salary
Department
Designation
Manager
Employment Status
Joining Date
Payroll configuration
```

unless explicitly authorized.

---

