```text
Employee
 ↓
Change Request
 ↓
HR/Manager Review
 ↓
Approved / Rejected
 ↓
Employee Record Updated
```

Store:

```text
Old Value
New Value
Reason
Requested By
Reviewed By
Status
Timestamp
```

Maintain audit history.

