# 17. MOBILE ATTENDANCE

The mobile/PWA experience should support:

```text
Check In
Check Out
Location Capture
Geofence Validation
Selfie Verification where enabled
Attendance Status
```

Reuse Phase 5 verification mechanisms.

---

# 18. MOBILE LOCATION SECURITY

When location is required:

* Request permission appropriately.
* Explain why location is needed.
* Do not continuously track employees unnecessarily.
* Capture only required location data.
* Enforce geofence rules on the backend.
* Never trust frontend GPS values.

The backend must validate attendance.

