# 57. NOTIFICATION DEEP LINKS

Notifications should navigate users to the correct page.

Example:

```text
"Leave request approved"
       ↓
/leave/requests/123
```

Deep links must still perform authorization.

Never assume notification ownership grants access.

---

# 58. NOTIFICATION PREFERENCES

Allow users to configure supported notification channels.

Examples:

```text
Email
In-App
Push
```

Categories:

```text
Mandatory
Operational
Optional
Marketing only if applicable
```

Mandatory HR notifications should not be silently disabled if business rules require them.

