---

# 71. GLOBAL SEARCH SECURITY

Never search the database globally and filter only in the frontend.

Incorrect:

```text
Database
 ↓
All Records
 ↓
Frontend Filter
```

Correct:

```text
User
 ↓
Permissions
 ↓
Tenant Scope
 ↓
Authorized Query
 ↓
Results
```

---

