Follow this sequence exactly:

```text
STEP 1
Inspect repository

↓

STEP 2
Understand Phase 1–10 architecture

↓

STEP 3
Map reusable services

↓

STEP 4
Map existing employee/HR entities

↓

STEP 5
Design Phase 11 extension

↓

STEP 6
Implement database migrations

↓

STEP 7
Implement Employee Self-Service

↓

STEP 8
Implement Manager Self-Service

↓

STEP 9
Implement Documents

↓

STEP 10
Implement HR Requests

↓

STEP 11
Implement Helpdesk

↓

STEP 12
Implement Announcements/Communication

↓

STEP 13
Implement Unified Tasks

↓

STEP 14
Implement Notification Center

