↓

STEP 23
Provide final implementation report
```

---

# 140. MOST IMPORTANT RULE

## INSPECT FIRST → UNDERSTAND SECOND → DESIGN THIRD → IMPLEMENT FOURTH → TEST FIFTH → SECURE SIXTH → DOCUMENT LAST

Do not blindly generate files.

Do not recreate existing modules.

Do not create a second authentication system.

Do not create a second RBAC system.

Do not create a second notification system.

Do not create a second workflow engine.

Do not create a second attendance engine.

Do not create a second payroll engine.

Do not create a second employee system.

Do not bypass tenant isolation.

Do not trust frontend authorization.

Do not expose confidential employee information.

Do not cache sensitive employee data insecurely.

Do not break Phases 1–10.

The objective is to transform AxonTimeHR into a **unified employee-facing HR platform** where employees, managers, HR teams, and administrators can perform their daily HR activities through a secure, responsive, mobile-friendly, self-service experience.

# END OF AXONTIMEHR PHASE 11 DEVELOPMENT PROMPT
